Output "docs/previews/tui-overview.gif"
Set Shell "nu"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1400
Set Height 800
Set Padding 8
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Set WindowBar Colorful
Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Type "./target/release/droidkraft-tui --graphics halfblocks"
Enter
Show
Sleep 9s
Type "1"
Sleep 3s
Type "t"
Sleep 2s
Type "t"
Sleep 2s
Type "q"
